      dct:created "2026-04-06"^^xsd:date ;
      dct:description "Revised meeting note recording CTO Quinton Fairweather's decision to abandon Zypherion and adopt Meridian for the analytics pipeline, citing critical gaps in Zypherion's streaming ingestion. Same Q3 2026 migration window retained." ;
